e>Wei</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Xiang</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The effect of acute stress on LTP and LTD induction in the hippocampal CA1 region of anesthetized rats at three different ages</article-title><source><italic>Brain Research</italic></source><year>2004</year><volume>1005</volume><issue>1-2</issue><fpage>187</fpage><lpage>192</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15044077</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>18</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maroun</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Richter-Levin</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Local circuit plasticity in the rat dentate gyrus: characterization and aging-related impairment</article-title><source><italic>Neuroscience</italic></source><year>2002</year><volume>112</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>1001</fpage><lpage>1007</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12088757</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B19"><label>19</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Akirav</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Richter-Levin</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Biphasic modulation of hippocampal plasticity by behavioral stress and basolateral amygdala stimulation in the rat</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Neuroscience</italic></source><year>1999</year><volume>19</volume><issue>23</issue><fpage>10530</fpage><lpage>10535</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10575049</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B20"><label>20</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Akirav</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surn